WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.750
A projectile is fired from a sprite, and it's its own kind: Projectile.

2
00:00:06.026 --> 00:00:10.051
So a hit is an overlap between a projectile and an enemy.

3
00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:15.805
Array of sprites of kind enemy is a list of every enemy right now.

4
00:00:18.709 --> 00:00:23.509
A for element loop runs once for each one, so one press destroys them all.
